#: ../../library/os.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!os` --- Miscellaneous operating system interfaces"
msgstr ":mod:`!os` --- 各種作業系統介面"

#: ../../library/os.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/os.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/os.py`"

#: ../../library/os.rst:11
msgid ""
"This module provides a portable way of using operating system dependent "
"functionality.  If you just want to read or write a file see :func:`open`, "
"if you want to manipulate paths, see the :mod:`os.path` module, and if you "
"want to read all the lines in all the files on the command line see "
"the :mod:`fileinput` module.  For creating temporary files and directories "
"see the :mod:`tempfile` module, and for high-level file and directory "
"handling see the :mod:`shutil` module."
msgstr ""
"此模組提供了一種可移植的方式來使用與作業系統相關的功能。如果你只想讀取或寫入"
"檔案，請參閱 :func:`open`；如果你想操作路徑，請參閱 :mod:`os.path` 模組；如果"
"你想讀取命令列上所有檔案中的所有列，請參閱 :mod:`fileinput` 模組。要建立臨時"
"檔案和目錄，請參閱 :mod:`tempfile` 模組；要進行高階的檔案和目錄處理，請參"
"閱 :mod:`shutil` 模組。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:19
msgid "Notes on the availability of these functions:"
msgstr "關於這些功能的可用性說明："

#: ../../library/os.rst:21
msgid ""
"The design of all built-in operating system dependent modules of Python is "
"such that as long as the same functionality is available, it uses the same "
"interface; for example, the function ``os.stat(path)`` returns stat "
"information about *path* in the same format (which happens to have "
"originated with the POSIX interface)."
msgstr ""
"Python 所有內建的作業系統相依模組，其設計原則是：只要有相同的功能可用，就會使"
"用相同的介面 (interface)。舉例來說，``os.stat(path)`` 函式會以相同格式回傳關"
"於 *path* 的 stat 資訊（這個格式剛好源自 POSIX 介面）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:27
msgid ""
"Extensions peculiar to a particular operating system are also available "
"through the :mod:`!os` module, but using them is of course a threat to "
"portability."
msgstr ""
"對於特定的作業系統獨有的擴充功能也可以透過 :mod:`!os` 取得，但使用它們的時候"
"對於可移植性無疑會是個問題。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:31
msgid ""
"All functions accepting path or file names accept both bytes and string "
"objects, and result in an object of the same type, if a path or file name is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"所有接受檔案路徑和檔案名稱的函式皆接受位元組 (bytes) 和字串物件 (string "
"objects)，且如果回傳檔案路徑或檔案名稱，則會產出相同型別的物件。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:35
msgid ""
"On VxWorks, os.popen, os.fork, os.execv and os.spawn*p* are not supported."
msgstr "在 VxWorks 上，不支援 os.popen、os.fork、os.execv 和 os.spawn*p*。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:37
msgid ""
"On WebAssembly platforms, Android and iOS, large parts of the :mod:`!os` "
"module are not available or behave differently. APIs related to processes "
"(e.g. :func:`~os.fork`, :func:`~os.execve`) and resources "
"(e.g. :func:`~os.nice`) are not available. Others like :func:`~os.getuid` "
"and :func:`~os.getpid` are emulated or stubs. WebAssembly platforms also "
"lack support for signals (e.g. :func:`~os.kill`, :func:`~os.wait`)."
msgstr ""
"在 WebAssembly 平台、Android 與 iOS 上，:mod:`!os` 模組中有很大一部分無法使用"
"或行為不同。與行程 (process)（例如 :func:`~os.fork`、:func:`~os.execve`）與資"
"源（例如 :func:`~os.nice`）相關的 API 無法使用。其他像是 :func:`~os.getuid` "
"和 :func:`~os.getpid` 則是模擬的或是 stub。WebAssembly 平台也缺少訊號相關支援"
"（例如 :func:`~os.kill`、:func:`~os.wait`）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:47
msgid ""
"All functions in this module raise :exc:`OSError` (or subclasses thereof) in "
"the case of invalid or inaccessible file names and paths, or other arguments "
"that have the correct type, but are not accepted by the operating system."
msgstr ""
"在檔案名稱和路徑找不到或無效的時候，或引數型別正確但作業系統不接受的時候，在"
"此模組中的所有的函式都會引發 :exc:`OSError`\\ （或其子類別）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:53
msgid "An alias for the built-in :exc:`OSError` exception."
msgstr "內建例外 :exc:`OSError` 的別名。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:58
msgid ""
"The name of the operating system dependent module imported.  The following "
"names have currently been registered: ``'posix'``, ``'nt'``, ``'java'``."
msgstr ""
"所引入的作業系統相依模組名稱。目前已註冊的名稱有：``'posix'``、``'nt'``、"
"``'java'``。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:63
msgid ""
":data:`sys.platform` has a finer granularity.  :func:`os.uname` gives system-"
"dependent version information."
msgstr ""
":data:`sys.platform` 的粒度更細。:func:`os.uname` 提供與系統相關的版本資訊。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:66 ../../library/os.rst:813
msgid ""
"The :mod:`platform` module provides detailed checks for the system's "
"identity."
msgstr ":mod:`platform` 模組提供了對系統識別資訊的詳細檢查。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:74
msgid "File Names, Command Line Arguments, and Environment Variables"
msgstr "檔案名稱、命令列引數與環境變數"

#: ../../library/os.rst:76
msgid ""
"In Python, file names, command line arguments, and environment variables are "
"represented using the string type. On some systems, decoding these strings "
"to and from bytes is necessary before passing them to the operating system. "
"Python uses the :term:`filesystem encoding and error handler` to perform "
"this conversion (see :func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding`)."
msgstr ""
"在 Python 中，檔案名稱、命令列引數與環境變數都以字串型別表示。在某些系統上，"
"將這些字串傳給作業系統之前，必須先在字串與位元組之間進行解碼與編碼。Python 使"
"用\\ :term:`檔案系統編碼和錯誤處理函式 <filesystem encoding and error "
"handler>`\\ 來進行此轉換（請參閱 :func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding`）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:82
msgid ""
"The :term:`filesystem encoding and error handler` are configured at Python "
"startup by the :c:func:`PyConfig_Read` function: "
"see :c:member:`~PyConfig.filesystem_encoding` "
"and :c:member:`~PyConfig.filesystem_errors` members of :c:type:`PyConfig`."
msgstr ""
":term:`檔案系統編碼和錯誤處理函式 <filesystem encoding and error handler>`\\ "
"會在 Python 啟動時由 :c:func:`PyConfig_Read` 函式設定：請參"
"閱 :c:type:`PyConfig` 的 :c:member:`~PyConfig.filesystem_encoding` "
"與 :c:member:`~PyConfig.filesystem_errors` 成員。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:87
msgid ""
"On some systems, conversion using the file system encoding may fail. In this "
"case, Python uses the :ref:`surrogateescape encoding error handler "
"<surrogateescape>`, which means that undecodable bytes are replaced by a "
"Unicode character U+DC\\ *xx* on decoding, and these are again translated to "
"the original byte on encoding."
msgstr ""
"在某些系統上，使用檔案系統編碼進行轉換可能會失敗。在這種情況下，Python 會使"
"用 :ref:`surrogateescape 編碼錯誤處理函式 <surrogateescape>`，這表示無法解碼"
"的位元組在解碼時會被替換為 Unicode 字元 U+DC\\ *xx*，並在編碼時再被轉換回原本"
"的位元組。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:95
msgid ""
"The :term:`file system encoding <filesystem encoding and error handler>` "
"must guarantee to successfully decode all bytes below 128. If the file "
"system encoding fails to provide this guarantee, API functions can "
"raise :exc:`UnicodeError`."
msgstr ""
":term:`檔案系統編碼 <filesystem encoding and error handler>`\\ 必須保證能成功"
"解碼所有低於 128 的位元組。如果檔案系統編碼無法提供此保證，API 函式可能會引"
"發 :exc:`UnicodeError`。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:100
msgid "See also the :term:`locale encoding`."
msgstr "另請參閱\\ :term:`區域編碼 <locale encoding>`。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:106
msgid "Python UTF-8 Mode"
msgstr "Python UTF-8 模式"

#: ../../library/os.rst:108
msgid "See :pep:`540` for more details."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 :pep:`540`。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:113
msgid ""
"Python UTF-8 mode is now enabled by default (:pep:`686`). It may be disabled "
"by setting :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8=0 <PYTHONUTF8>` as an environment variable or "
"by using the :option:`-X utf8=0 <-X>` command line option."
msgstr ""
"Python UTF-8 模式現在預設為啟用（:pep:`686`）。可以透過"
"將 :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8=0 <PYTHONUTF8>` 設為環境變數，或使用 :option:`-X "
"utf8=0 <-X>` 命令列選項來停用它。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:117
msgid ""
"The Python UTF-8 Mode ignores the :term:`locale encoding` and forces the "
"usage of the UTF-8 encoding:"
msgstr ""
"Python 在 UTF-8 模式下會忽略\\ :term:`區域編碼 <locale encoding>`\\ 並且強制"
"使用 UTF-8 去編碼："

#: ../../library/os.rst:120
msgid ""
"Use UTF-8 as the :term:`filesystem encoding <filesystem encoding and error "
"handler>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 UTF-8 作為\\ :term:`檔案系統編碼 <filesystem encoding and error "
"handler>`。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:122
msgid ":func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding` returns ``'utf-8'``."
msgstr ":func:`sys.getfilesystemencoding` 回傳 ``'utf-8'``。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:123
msgid ""
":func:`locale.getpreferredencoding` returns ``'utf-8'`` (the *do_setlocale* "
"argument has no effect)."
msgstr ""
":func:`locale.getpreferredencoding` 回傳 ``'utf-8'``\\ （*do_setlocale* 引數"
"並無任何效果）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:125
msgid ""
":data:`sys.stdin`, :data:`sys.stdout`, and :data:`sys.stderr` all use UTF-8 "
"as their text encoding, with the ``surrogateescape`` :ref:`error handler "
"<error-handlers>` being enabled for :data:`sys.stdin` and :data:`sys.stdout` "
"(:data:`sys.stderr` continues to use ``backslashreplace`` as it does in the "
"default locale-aware mode)"
msgstr ""
":data:`sys.stdin`、:data:`sys.stdout` 和 :data:`sys.stderr` 都使用 UTF-8 作為"
"文字編碼，其中 :data:`sys.stdin` 和 :data:`sys.stdout` 會啟用 "
"``surrogateescape`` :ref:`錯誤處理函式 <error-handlers>`\\ "
"（:data:`sys.stderr` 則和預設的區域感知 (locale-aware) 模式一樣，繼續使用 "
"``backslashreplace``）"

#: ../../library/os.rst:130
msgid ""
"On Unix, :func:`os.device_encoding` returns ``'utf-8'`` rather than the "
"device encoding."
msgstr "在 Unix 中，:func:`os.device_encoding` 回傳 ``'utf-8'`` 而非裝置編碼。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:133
msgid ""
"Note that the standard stream settings in UTF-8 mode can be overridden "
"by :envvar:`PYTHONIOENCODING` (just as they can be in the default locale-"
"aware mode)."
msgstr ""
"請注意，在 UTF-8 模式中，標準的串流設定會被 :envvar:`PYTHONIOENCODING` 覆蓋"
"（如同在預設的區域感知模式中一樣）。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:137
msgid ""
"As a consequence of the changes in those lower level APIs, other higher "
"level APIs also exhibit different default behaviours:"
msgstr ""
"由於這些較低層級 API 的變更，其他較高層級的 API 也會表現出不同的預設行為："

#: ../../library/os.rst:140
msgid ""
"Command line arguments, environment variables and filenames are decoded to "
"text using the UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr "命令列引數、環境變數及檔案名稱會以 UTF-8 編碼形式來被解碼成文字。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:142
msgid ":func:`os.fsdecode` and :func:`os.fsencode` use the UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr ":func:`os.fsdecode` 和 :func:`os.fsencode` 使用 UTF-8 編碼。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:143
msgid ""
":func:`open`, :func:`io.open`, and :func:`codecs.open` use the UTF-8 "
"encoding by default. However, they still use the strict error handler by "
"default so that attempting to open a binary file in text mode is likely to "
"raise an exception rather than producing nonsense data."
msgstr ""
":func:`open`、:func:`io.open` 和 :func:`codecs.open` 預設使用 UTF-8 編碼。然"
"而，它們預設仍使用 strict 錯誤處理函式，因此嘗試以文字模式開啟二進位檔案時，"
"很可能會引發例外，而不是產生無意義的資料。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:148
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>` is enabled by default. It can be "
"disabled using the :option:`-X utf8=0 <-X>` command line option or "
"the :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8=0 <PYTHONUTF8>` environment variable. The Python "
"UTF-8 Mode can only be disabled at Python startup. Its value can be read "
"from :data:`sys.flags.utf8_mode <sys.flags>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`\\ 預設為啟用。可以使用 :option:`-X "
"utf8=0 <-X>` 命令列選項或 :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8=0 <PYTHONUTF8>` 環境變數來停用"
"它。Python UTF-8 模式只能在 Python 啟動時停用。其值可以"
"從 :data:`sys.flags.utf8_mode <sys.flags>` 讀取。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:154
msgid ""
"If the UTF-8 mode is disabled, the interpreter defaults to using the current "
"locale settings, *unless* the current locale is identified as a legacy ASCII-"
"based locale (as described for :envvar:`PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE`), and locale "
"coercion is either disabled or fails. In such legacy locales, the "
"interpreter will default to enabling UTF-8 mode unless explicitly instructed "
"not to do so."
msgstr ""
"如果停用了 UTF-8 模式，直譯器預設會使用目前的區域設定，*除非*\\ 目前的區域設"
"定被識別為舊式的 ASCII 區域設定（如 :envvar:`PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE` 中所述），"
"且區域設定強制轉換 (locale coercion) 已停用或失敗。在這類舊式區域設定中，除非"
"明確指示不要這麼做，否則直譯器預設會啟用 UTF-8 模式。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:161
msgid ""
"See also the :ref:`UTF-8 mode on Windows <win-utf8-mode>` and "
"the :term:`filesystem encoding and error handler`."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 :ref:`Windows 上的 UTF-8 模式 <win-utf8-mode>`\\ 與\\ :term:`檔案系"
"統編碼和錯誤處理函式 <filesystem encoding and error handler>`。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:168
msgid "Process Parameters"
msgstr "行程參數"

#: ../../library/os.rst:170
msgid ""
"These functions and data items provide information and operate on the "
"current process and user."
msgstr "這些函式和資料項目提供關於目前行程與使用者的資訊，並可對其進行操作。"

#: ../../library/os.rst:176
msgid ""
"Return the filename corresponding to the controlling terminal of the process."
msgstr "回傳對應於該行程之控制終端機的檔案名稱。"

